mtp-sidecar-subfolder.patch, 2026-11-10. Base: llama.cpp master 7592b61d3. Apply: git apply
common : find MTP sidecars in a sibling mtp/ subfolder, log the pick

The -hf sidecar auto-pick only searched the model's directory and its ancestors, so a repo that keeps its
heads in a subfolder (e.g. MTP/) silently ran without MTP. Also accept a subfolder named after the sidecar
kind (case-insensitive) under the model's directory or an ancestor; a file in the model's own directory still
wins. Log the chosen sidecar, and warn naming the searched locations when --spec-type draft-mtp finds none.

